+"""G-track validation on the T CrB grism series — corrected library.
+
+This runner replaces the 2026-08-18 validation pass.  That pass solved a
+dispersion per frame, used a header gain that was four times too small
+and masked every pixel above 16.3 kADU; the committee review of
+2026-10-03 withdrew all three (findings OA.E1, DE.F1, TE.F3, PH.P7).
+What runs here is the corrected library, on EVERY T CrB hrg/lrg frame
