+``run_g_reduce.py --sample tcrb`` — no stage below reads the archive.
+
+STAGES (each independent; ``--all`` chains them)
+------------------------------------------------
+``--zero``      per-frame zero point (Halpha emission) under the FIXED
+                detector-coordinate solution, and the O2-B edge check:
+                the acceptance test of G-1 (edge wavelength constant
+                across the series)                       -> g_zero_point
+``--variance``  G-2: measured vs predicted sky variance in the trace
+                flanks, per frame, and the photon-transfer fit over all
+                frames (an independent gain measurement)  -> g_variance_check
+``--null``      G-4: empty-aperture residual of each sky model, the
+                straight-line-vs-polynomial method difference and the
